hello_world.bin and partition-table.bin in this folder are an app image and a partition
table built from ESP-IDF's hello_world example with ESP-IDF v5.5.5, the tag v5.5.5 of
https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf, and its toolchain esp-14.2.0_20260121. The table
places the app at 0x10000.

The app image links ESP-IDF's components. They are under the Apache License 2.0, whose text is
LICENSE-rom in this folder, apart from the files whose headers name other terms. Among those,
the FreeRTOS kernel is under the MIT License, reproduced with its notice in LICENSE-freertos,
and the Xtensa core HAL under the notice reproduced in LICENSE-xtensa. The FreeRTOS Xtensa
port and the Xtensa interrupt, context and vector files are under that same notice, with the
line Copyright (c) 2015-2019 Cadence Design Systems, Inc. The TLSF heap allocator is under the
BSD-3-Clause License, reproduced with its notice in LICENSE-tlsf, and the undefined behaviour
sanitizer hooks under the BSD-2-Clause terms reproduced with their notice in LICENSE-ubsan.
The image also holds routines of the toolchain's C library, newlib, under the notices of
LICENSE-newlib, and of the compiler's support library, under the GCC Runtime Library Exception.

hello_world/main/hello_world_main.c is ESP-IDF's hello_world example, under CC0-1.0, with two
lines added.
